<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Sweater knitting happens on our own machines, with gauge — typically 7GG to 12GG depending on the weight you want — set and held consistently across a production run rather than varying batch to batch the way subcontracted knitting sometimes does. GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001 certification cover the facility.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">We handle both intarsia knitting for large blocks of color and jacquard knitting for smaller repeating patterns, plus the blocking and finishing steps that set a knit sweater's final shape and drape. Minimum order is 300 pieces per style, with yarn sourcing, knitting, finishing, and export documentation included.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Knitwear categories like sweaters benefit from Bangladesh's roughly 54% knitwear export share and the trade terms that come with it: continued EU duty-free access under Everything But Arms through November 2029 despite LDC graduation in November 2026, and a 20% US tariff cap from late 2025 that keeps exposure below Chinese-made knitwear facing Section 301 duties.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section>
